  <para style="q3">long ol promis bilong yu,  
</para>
  <para style="q2">olsem wanpela man  
</para>
  <para style="q3">i kisim planti gol samting.   
<verse eid="PSA 119:162"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163"/>Mi no laik tru long pasin giaman  
